KagNode. Proxy software is AGPL-3.0-only.

The native installer protocol and reproducible source/package tooling were
adapted from every-lemon/kagnode-cli, public commit
ad9b54ef69fd5edfbbe97d4cdaf1abf9d1b7d16d. These files retain AGPL-3.0-only
licensing. Project-owned proxy, authentication, certificate and maintenance
rules are implemented in this repository.

KagNode Core is vendored with its corresponding readable source, AGPL license,
artwork permissions and upstream notices. Core provenance is in core.lock.json.
Nginx, Certbot and the optional 3proxy engine are separate upstream projects;
installing this application does not change their licenses or qualify their
native operation on an unsupported platform.
